{"id":"n58719-1-2","stage":1,"title":"백만 · 百万","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58719-1-2-1","ko":"영화는 어땠어?","zh":"那部电影怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영화는","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c2f3f03d3ff1012b20a3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58719-1-2-2","ko":"왜 관람객이 백만이 넘는지 알겠어. 정말 재미있고 감동적이야.","zh":"现在明白为什么观众会超过一百万了。真的非常有趣又感人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관람객이","meaning":"参观者，观众","explanation":"관람객：参观者，观众；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"관람객","audio":"/audio/01276a62f4ec1f0f5a91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23982","senseId":"1","lemma":"관람객","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"백만이","meaning":"百万","explanation":"백만：百万；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"백만","audio":"/audio/2016bf581f0de4489f42.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58719","senseId":"1","lemma":"백만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘는지","meaning":"超过","explanation":"넘다：超过；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"넘다","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64524","senseId":"8","lemma":"넘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알겠어.","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미있고","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감동적이야.","meaning":"感人的，动人的","explanation":"감동적：感人的，动人的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"감동적","audio":"/audio/b5ac8c4d76903cbd3069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15451","senseId":"1","lemma":"감동적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"01276a62f4ec1f0f","term":"관람객","zh":"参观者，观众","audio":"/audio/01276a62f4ec1f0f5a91.mp3","entryId":"23982","definition":"观览文物、画作、雕刻等展示品或观看演出、电影、运动比赛等的人。","pronunciation":["괄람객"]},{"id":"2016bf581f0de448","term":"백만","zh":"百万","audio":"/audio/2016bf581f0de4489f42.mp3","entryId":"58719","definition":"万的百倍的数目。","pronunciation":["뱅만"]},{"id":"bd8fe9471c90dfb8","term":"넘다","zh":"超过","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3","entryId":"64524","definition":"成为某种以上的状态。","pronunciation":["넘ː따"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"b5ac8c4d76903cbd","term":"감동적","zh":"感人的，动人的","audio":"/audio/b5ac8c4d76903cbd3069.mp3","entryId":"15451","definition":"有强烈感受后心动的。","pronunciation":["감ː동적"]}],"audio":"/audio/a5057a45670e8f0411a8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58719","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":1.9853,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["现在明白为什么观众会超过一百万了。真的非常有趣又感人。","听说隔壁夫妻俩在事故中突然去世了？","那部电影怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["现在明白为什么观众会超过一百万了。真的非常有趣又感人。","那部电影怎么样？","听说隔壁夫妻俩在事故中突然去世了？"],"answer":0}]}
